busercontent.com/u/13497577?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141","html_url":"https://github.com/Crono141","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crono141/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":429,"digest":"sha256:9a8f64ab4d32e40156e33cc3fd6fd7a91a77356ca32515683f98bf1437322f64","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-11-25T04:49:50Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T04:49:50Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Crono141/battle-at-antares/releases/download/v0.7.1/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Crono141/battle-at-antares/tarball/v0.7.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Crono141/battle-at-antares/zipball/v0.7.1","body":"# Battle at Antares 0.7.1\n\nA fix for a crash in 0.7.0: at some window sizes, opening the **Colonies** panel made the galaxy\nzoom out further and further until the game crashed. Everything else is as in 0.7.0.\n\nYou need your own Master of Orion II 1.31 (GOG or Steam). None of the original game's files are in\nthese downloads.\n\nIf you enjoy Battle at Antares, you can support it on [Ko-fi](https://ko-fi.com/crono141).\n\n## Downloads\n\n- `battle-at-antares-0.7.1-windows-x86_64.zip`: Windows 10 or later, 64-bit.\n- `battle-at-antares-0.7.1-linux-x86_64.tar.gz`: any 64-bit Linux with glibc 2.36 or later.\n- `battle-at-antares-0.7.1-macos-arm64.zip`: macOS 11 or later on Apple Silicon (M1 and later).\n  **Experimental:** built and checked on GitHub's Mac machines, not yet played on a real Mac;\n  unsigned (`INSTALL.txt` says how to let it run). Reports are very welcome.\n- `battle-at-antares-0.7.1-source.tar.gz`: the source of this build (GPLv3).\n- HD art (optional, recommended): the packs from the\n  [battle-at-antares-hd 0.1.0 release](https://github.com/Crono141/battle-at-antares-hd/releases/tag/v0.1.0)\n  work with 0.7.1 unchanged.\n\nUpgrading from 0.7.0 or 0.6.x: extract the new download over the old one. Saves, game settings and\nthe HD packs stay as they are.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- **Colonies panel crash.** 0.7.0 added a small gap before every scroll bar, but the Colonies job\n  columns still reckoned with the old bar width. Each time the rows were laid out they came out a\n  little too wide, the panel grew to fit them, the columns widened again, and the galaxy refitted\n  itself beside the panel every frame until the game crashed. The columns now measure the scroll\n  bar as it is drawn.\n"}